  :adr/not-done
  "Nothing was deployed and nothing could have been: both Workers are unbuildable and all four of their declared routes are NXDOMAIN. The Python pods were compiled, not executed -- requirements.txt was not installed and none of the 13 Kubernetes manifests were applied, so nothing here says whether the dumpers work against live sources. The nine unparseable files were not repaired (decision 2), the vitest glob was not widened (decision 4), the Mapillary token was not deleted (decision 1), and the sdk packaging problem was not filed upstream, because app-live's docs/adr/2608180536 already records the options. kotoba/README.md's per-topic table was left as-is: correcting it means deciding whether the 11 dead suites are counted, which is the same decision as 4. CLAUDE.md's monorepo-relative links were not repaired, because fixing them means deciding whether this repository keeps citing the monorepo or becomes self-contained.

The maturity axis raised this round was docs. axis-test was not raised and could not honestly have been: the fleet scanner counts only #{cljc cljs clj kotoba} under a top-level src/ or test/, so this repository's TypeScript and Python suites are structurally invisible to it, and adding .cljc files to move the counter would be padding. axis-ingest was not raised either -- listing URLs to move a counter is fabrication."
